WEBVTT

00:10:29.902 --> 00:10:31.152
but that's another story.

00:10:33.652 --> 00:10:36.670
He protected it by giving it
to the next generation,

00:10:36.694 --> 00:10:38.378
by giving it to my grandmother,

00:10:38.402 --> 00:10:40.402
and she gave it to me.

00:10:42.777 --> 00:10:45.670
When I first heard
the sound of this instrument,

00:10:45.694 --> 00:10:46.944
it haunted me.

00:10:47.944 --> 00:10:51.902
It felt like hearing a wanderer
in the Himalayan fog.

00:10:53.361 --> 00:10:55.861
It felt like hearing
a voice from the past.

00:10:56.986 --> 00:11:00.777
(Music)